        "poison"
      ],
      "description": "<p>An abyssal fungus can unleash a cloud of spores that irritates the eyes and throats of non-fungi creatures in a 15ft Emanation. Each creature must succeed at a DC 14 Fortitude Saving Throw save or take 1d4 Persistent,poison Damage.</p>\n<p>A creature has its vision reduced as long as the persistent damage continues and can see only within 20 feet (10 feet on a critical failure).</p>",
